The bundled transports here were changed after their .sig files were made (JS
ports brought in step with the native transports, see
docs/plans/2026-10-04-native-js-parity.md). The signatures are stale until the
holder of the official key runs:

    transport/script/js/build.sh ~/oflx-keys/script-signing.key

which rebuilds, signs and deletes this file. Until then the apps must not ship
these bundles as "official" (they would fail the signature check).
